  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is to deepen community engagement and improve the quality in primary education. It will generate a demand for engagement, facilitate enrolment and retention, monitor allocation and expenditure of schools, tracking entitlements under Real Time Evaluation (RTE) and will act to bring about a strong grievance system and ensure accountability of school support system.</narrative>
